  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n![Halloween header](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/images/48a4696c4e637a5d782c49df7fc51fc817a02f90.jpeg)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">萬聖節混搭包</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/halloween-mash-up\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/halloween-mash-up\">\n  <img alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub 贊助者\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n萬聖節快樂！穿上應景的恐怖服裝，準備迎接極致的《我的世界》萬聖節驚險之旅！\n<p></p>\n\n本資源包包含方塊、物品、實體、介面以及全新配樂的詭異紋理！\n<p></p>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n\n![world preview](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/images/c77959cfdd3a64bbf94807b633c1e20d9bd4028e.jpeg)\n\n![Legacy 4J 模組支援](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/images/b6c62b6d26a6b675ddc9b7849e3c03970349615c.png)\n\n內建支援 [Legacy4J](https://modrinth.com/mod/legacy4j) 模組。\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>更多資源包</summary>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th align=\"center\">圖示</th>\n      <th>名稱</th>\n      <th>下載次數</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https:/